  "description": "Gabriel, who had been working in the city, loses all his money to a scam and returns to his hometown. With no job prospects, he finds himself in a difficult situation—until Adam Frost, his ex from six years ago, shows up. Adam offers a generous sum to have Gabriel move into his house and take care of the household chores. Torn but with little choice, Gabriel accepts the offer and begins living under the same roof as Adam once again…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/1year1day), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/1year1day)",
